- Story & Context: Within the cramped confines of the station, the younger apprentice Hanne discovers a hidden cache of logs dating back to the 1920s that suggest the keepers were never actually guiding ships, but instead luring them toward a specific gravity well. As the temperature drops, she finds a rusted radio key and realizes her heartbeat is starting to match the tempo of the signal. She whispers her confession to the empty, freezing room, "I am the frequency they were waiting for."
